id: cutthroat-teamwork-second-effect
name: 2nd effect of Cutthroat Teamwork
type: standard
actionCost: 1
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
fromTrait: cutthroat-teamwork
fromEffect: 2
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Cutthroat Teamwork's second effect, as a Maneuver: a Might Clash against an Ally on an adjacent Square - won, they may be moved within a Large Sphere centred on you.
text: >
  (2)-[1/Round]: As a Standard Maneuver with an Action Cost of 1, you may target an Ally on an adjacent Square. Make a Might Clash against them. If you win, you may move that Ally onto any Square within a Large Sphere AoE (centered on you).

---

# Warriors of Glass's first effect's shape: owned by every character, in the list only while Cutthroat Teamwork is had
# (`fromTrait`). Used, which Ally beside you asked, and the Might Clash opened; where they land, the map's (chat.mjs
# cutthroatShove).
[on used]
cutthroatShove();
